        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Qwen Image Edit 2511 Int8- Image Edit\n\nEdit images with Qwen Image Edit 2511 Int8, using a quantized model for faster inference while maintaining high quality. Input one image and receive one edited output. Ideal for character-consistent portrait editing, multi-person group photo fusion, and industrial design modifications. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/image_qwen_image_edit_2511_int8.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
